{"id":3411,"slug":"3411-v-model-modifiers-built-in-va-custom-modifiers","category":"Vue.js","subcategory":"Component Communication","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"v-model modifiers — built-in và custom modifiers?","question_en":"v-model modifiers — built-in and custom modifiers?","answer_vi":"**Built-in modifiers**:\n- `.lazy`: sync sau `change` event thay vì `input` — giảm updates\n- `.number`: auto convert sang `number` (tương đương `parseFloat`)\n- `.trim`: auto trim whitespace\n\n```vue\n<input v-model.lazy=\"search\" />       <!-- Update khi blur/enter -->\n<input v-model.number=\"age\" type=\"number\" />\n<input v-model.trim=\"name\" />\n```\n\n**Custom modifiers** cho component v-model:\n```typescript\n// Child component\nconst props = defineProps<{\n  modelValue: string\n  modelModifiers?: { uppercase?: boolean; capitalize?: boolean }\n}>()\nconst emit = defineEmits<{ 'update:modelValue': [value: string] }>()\n\nfunction handleInput(e: Event) {\n  let value = (e.target as HTMLInputElement).value\n  if (props.modelModifiers?.uppercase) value = value.toUpperCase()\n  if (props.modelModifiers?.capitalize) value = value.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + value.slice(1)\n  emit('update:modelValue', value)\n}\n```\n\n```vue\n<!-- Parent usage -->\n<MyInput v-model.uppercase=\"text\" />\n<MyInput v-model.capitalize=\"text\" />\n\n<!-- Multiple v-model với modifiers -->\n<MyInput v-model:title.capitalize=\"title\" v-model:content=\"content\" />\n```","answer_en":"**Built-in modifiers**:\n- `.lazy`: sync on `change` not `input`\n- `.number`: auto-convert to number\n- `.trim`: auto-trim whitespace\n\n```vue\n<input v-model.lazy=\"search\" />\n<input v-model.number=\"age\" />\n<input v-model.trim=\"name\" />\n```\n\n**Custom modifiers** in component v-model:\n```typescript\nconst props = defineProps<{\n  modelValue: string\n  modelModifiers?: { uppercase?: boolean }\n}>()\n\nfunction handleInput(e: Event) {\n  let val = (e.target as HTMLInputElement).value\n  if (props.modelModifiers?.uppercase) val = val.toUpperCase()\n  emit('update:modelValue', val)\n}\n```\n\n```vue\n<MyInput v-model.uppercase=\"text\" />\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Built-in modifiers</strong>:<br/>- <code>.lazy</code>: sync sau <code>change</code> event thay vì <code>input</code> — giảm updates<br/>- <code>.number</code>: auto convert sang <code>number</code> (tương đương <code>parseFloat</code>)<br/>- <code>.trim</code>: auto trim whitespace</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;input v-model.lazy=&quot;search&quot; /&gt;       &lt;!-- Update khi blur/enter --&gt;\n&lt;input v-model.number=&quot;age&quot; type=&quot;number&quot; /&gt;\n&lt;input v-model.trim=&quot;name&quot; /&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-model.lazy</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;search&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Update khi blur/enter --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-model.number</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;age&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;number&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-model.trim</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;name&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Custom modifiers</strong> cho component v-model:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// Child component\nconst props = defineProps&lt;{\n  modelValue: string\n  modelModifiers?: { uppercase?: boolean; capitalize?: boolean }\n}&gt;()\nconst emit = defineEmits&lt;{ 'update:modelValue': [value: string] }&gt;()\n\nfunction handleInput(e: Event) {\n  let value = (e.target as HTMLInputElement).value\n  if (props.modelModifiers?.uppercase) value = value.toUpperCase()\n  if (props.modelModifiers?.capitalize) value = value.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + value.slice(1)\n  emit('update:modelValue', value)\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Child component</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> props = defineProps&lt;{\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">modelValue</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">modelModifiers</span>?: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">uppercase</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">boolean</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attr\">capitalize</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">boolean</span> }\n}&gt;()\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> emit = defineEmits&lt;{ <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;update:modelValue&#x27;</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>] }&gt;()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">handleInput</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">e</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Event</span></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> value = (e.<span class=\"hljs-property\">target</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">HTMLInputElement</span>).<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (props.<span class=\"hljs-property\">modelModifiers</span>?.<span class=\"hljs-property\">uppercase</span>) value = value.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toUpperCase</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (props.<span class=\"hljs-property\">modelModifiers</span>?.<span class=\"hljs-property\">capitalize</span>) value = value.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">charAt</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toUpperCase</span>() + value.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">slice</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">emit</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;update:modelValue&#x27;</span>, value)\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- Parent usage --&gt;\n&lt;MyInput v-model.uppercase=&quot;text&quot; /&gt;\n&lt;MyInput v-model.capitalize=&quot;text&quot; /&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- Multiple v-model với modifiers --&gt;\n&lt;MyInput v-model:title.capitalize=&quot;title&quot; v-model:content=&quot;content&quot; /&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Parent usage --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">MyInput</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-model.uppercase</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">MyInput</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-model.capitalize</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Multiple v-model với modifiers --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">MyInput</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-model:title.capitalize</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;title&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">v-model:content</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;content&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Built-in modifiers</strong>:<br/>- <code>.laz